            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds compatibility data for the new <code class=\"notranslate\">controls</code> attribute on the HTML <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;img&gt;</code> element.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>HTML Standard: <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#attr-img-controls\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#attr-img-controls</a></li>\n<li>WHATWG PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3924343435\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12151\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/whatwg/html/pull/12151/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12151\">whatwg/html#12151</a></li>\n<li>Safari 27 support is documented with a note indicating the visionOS-specific implementation.</li>\n<li>The MDN content documentation is updated separately in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5638041939\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45930\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/45930/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/45930\">mdn/content#45930</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relates to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4237813633\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43730\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/43730/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.